CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION listdadisposition(serreqstatustypeid uuid, servicereqtypeconfigid uuid)
 RETURNS TABLE(servicerequesttypeconfigiddispostionid uuid, servicerequesttypeconfigid uuid, dispositioncode character varying, description text)
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$

BEGIN
RETURN QUERY 
SELECT a.servicerequesttypeconfigiddispostionid,a.servicerequesttypeconfigid,a.dispositioncode,a.description 
FROM ServiceRequestTypeConfigDispositionCode as a  WHERE 
a.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId=serreqstatustypeid
and a.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId=servicereqtypeconfigid and ActiveFlag=1 ORDER BY description;
END;

$function$

